  lines:
  - text: Uniting centuries-old Chinese congee techniques with Spanish-era cattle
      ranching traditions,
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'and heartfelt Filipino care customs this comforting, '
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: dish has long served as a remedy for the weary and unwell.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: ' Can you coax out that rich, comforting texture we all remember from childhood?'
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
